  "articleBody": "Plan a kitchen lighting upgrade by documenting the existing electrical layout, defining work zones, selecting layered fixtures, and coordinating installation with cabinetry and ceiling work. A remodeling team can then check fixture placement, dimming controls, wiring access, and permit needs before construction, helping prevent late changes that affect finishes, cost, or schedule.",
